"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The automation workflow centralizes these activities."}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"code-block","children":"Customer / Lead Data\n        ↓\nAudience Selection\n        ↓\nSegmentation\n        ↓\nAI Content Generation\n        ↓\nPersonalization\n        ↓\nEmail Delivery\n        ↓\nCampaign Tracking\n        ↓\nCRM / Database Update"}]]}],["$","$Ld",null,{"as":"article","className":"case-block","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"AI-Assisted Personalization"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"AI can be used to adapt content based on available customer context."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"For example:"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"code-block","children":"Customer Context\n      ↓\nCampaign Objective\n      ↓\nAI Content Generation\n      ↓\nPersonalized Message\n      ↓\nEmail Provider"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The AI layer is separated from the delivery layer so that content generation and email infrastructure remain independent."}]]}],["$","$Ld",null,{"as":"article","className":"case-block","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Automation Architecture"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"n8n can orchestrate the complete workflow:"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"code-block","children":"Trigger\n  ↓\nGet Contacts\n  ↓\nFilter / Segment\n  ↓\nPrepare Customer Context\n  ↓\nGenerate Content\n  ↓\nValidate Content\n  ↓\nSend Email\n  ↓\nCapture Result\n  ↓\nUpdate CRM"}]]}],["$","$Ld",null,{"as":"article","className":"case-block","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Reliability Considerations"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A production email automation system needs to account for:"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"chip-grid","children":[["$","span","Failed email delivery",{"className":"chip","children":"Failed email delivery"}],["$","span","API failures",{"className":"chip","children":"API failures"}],["$","span","Invalid customer data",{"className":"chip","children":"Invalid customer data"}],["$","span","Duplicate sends",{"class